2. Project Awareness (Singapore) Pte. Ltd. (UEN: 201320571D) shall not conduct (or continue to conduct) any fund‑raising appeal unless all the following conditions are satisfied:
(a)it has proper systems and control in place to ensure compliance with the Charities (Fund‑raising Appeals for Local and Foreign Charitable Purposes) Regulations 2012 (G.N. No. S 530/2012);
(b)the individual known as William Soh Sim Song (NRIC No. S7638187I) is not involved, directly or indirectly, in the conduct and management of any fund‑raising appeal;
(c)any bank account for the receipt of proceeds from any fund‑raising appeal it conducts must be in the name of Project Awareness (Singapore) Pte. Ltd. and no other.
